Usage:
  bb tasks <command> [options]

Commands:
  bb tasks status             Show the Tasks plugin name and version
  bb tasks project create     Create a tracker project
  bb tasks project list       List tracker projects
  bb tasks project show       Show one tracker project
  bb tasks project update     Rename, recolor, refile, or relink a tracker project
  bb tasks folder create      Create a project folder
  bb tasks folder list        List project folders
  bb tasks folder update      Rename or move a project folder
  bb tasks folder delete      Delete a folder and unfile its contents
  bb tasks create             Create a task
  bb tasks list               List and filter tasks
  bb tasks show               Show full task details
  bb tasks update             Update task fields and labels
  bb tasks comment            Add a markdown comment to a task
  bb tasks label create       Create a project label
  bb tasks label list         List a project's labels
  bb tasks label delete       Delete a project label
  bb tasks attachment add     Attach a file to a task or comment
  bb tasks attachment get     Download an attachment to a path
  bb tasks attachment list    List a task's attachments
  bb tasks attachment remove  Remove an attachment
  bb tasks preset list        List dispatch presets
  bb tasks preset show        Show one dispatch preset
  bb tasks preset create      Create a dispatch preset
